    crm:P67i_is_referred_to_by [ a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "wine (Latin vinum); in the customs accounts the default is Gascon wine, with many named types (Rhenish, malmsey, muscadel, romney, bastard, sack...) and origins. Soured wine / vinegar is a distinct concept." ;
